{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要責罰古實"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"唉！古實河外翅膀刷刷響聲之地，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣使者在水面上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐蒲草船過海。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知說：你們快行的使者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到高大光滑的民那裏去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自從開國以來，那民極其可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是分地界踐踏人的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的地有江河分開。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"世上一切的居民和地上所住的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山上豎立大旗的時候你們要看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹角的時候你們要聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華對我這樣說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要安靜，在我的居所觀看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同日光中的清熱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如露水的雲霧在收割的熱天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割之先，花開已謝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"花也成了將熟的葡萄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必用鐮刀削去嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又砍掉蔓延的枝條，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要撇給山間的鷙鳥和地上的野獸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏天，鷙鳥要宿在其上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冬天，野獸都臥在其中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"到那時，這高大光滑的民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是從開國以來極其可畏、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分地界踐踏人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的地有江河分開；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必將禮物奉給萬軍之耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是奉到錫安山－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華安置他名的地方。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}